---
description: Keep the WhatDoesThisDo reference pages in step with the code
alwaysApply: true
---

Functions and constants are documented in markdown pages under `docs/whatdoesthisdo/references/`, shown on hover by
the WhatDoesThisDo extension. Before changing a function or constant, read its entry. After creating, changing,
renaming, moving or deleting one, write, update or remove its entry in the same change, following the
`whatdoesthisdo` skill.
